"What is a Bitcoin blockchain certificate?\nThe Bitcoin blockchain certificate is at the core of the Bernstein service. It contains all the information regarding the documents registered on the blockchain: who the owner is, when the documents were registered, and where in the blockchain their cryptographic fingerprint was included (block number, transaction)."
