"Silverstar was sitting in our den when treeheart came in. He was one of the most agresive cats in the clan. She watched him and asked, \"What is it treeheart?\" he responded, \"Silverstar i know you dont like to fight, but I think we really need more territory, you know how scarce prey has gotten!\" \"We need more territory and you know it!\" Silverstar considered this for a moment, then said, \"Ok.\" but if they dont cooperate and the fight starts to get bad, we retreat.\nwe will attack the thunderclan border, for there prey never gets scarce. But i will take only 5 warriors, you, poppytail, frosteyes, Thornfur, and stonefoot. She got the warriors and headed for the thunderclan border. She didnt take darkpelt because she knew he wouldnt like her choice. She lead the cats through the forest, untill they reached the thunderclan border.\n\"what are you doing here\" hissed leapardfrost. leapard frost saw he was outnumbered and signaled for moonshine to get back up from the camp. moonshine ran back to camp. leapardfrost was infront of 5 warriors and 1 leader but leapardfrost had 3 warriors and an apprentice with him.\nSilverstar winced because she didnt want to fight. But she had been outvoted by her clan, so she had to try. \"We need more territory.\" she growled. \"Prey gets more scarce in shadowclan more than any other clan! We dont want to keep settleing for frogs and toads! we want a juicy mouse or a plump vole!\" she lunged at leapordfrost, and hoped she wouldnt hurt him. She slashed at him, claws unsheathed, and remembered her favorite move from when she was an apprentice. She slid across the ground, under leapordfrost, and grabbing his legs as she went by.\nSilverstar whipped around to face leapordfrost again. She lunged at him but missed and skidded in the dirt. She felt vulnrable down on the forest floor but just as she was about to scramble up, a new cat that she didnt know came and pinned her down. She had always been small, and this tom was very strong. She scrabled at his belly franticly with her hind legs in hopes of getting free.\nleapardfrost snorted to see that missingear has pined down his own apponet. all around him he could see cats fighting. moonshine came back but with only 1 extra cat. but atleast it was even. leapardfrost hoped onto a youger tom and started to fight with it.\nSilverstar finnaly was able to roll from under the tom, and pounce on it. She bit its neck hard, but not hard enouph to kill. Then she saw poppytail get pounced on and bit hard.\nAs they got closer to the edge, Silverstar jumped off the warrior and ran to try and push poppytail and frosteyes from the edge. But it was too late. The struggled, then slid off.\nleapardfrost couldnt stop frozenfang and mistyfur fall over the cliff eather. he ran straight to the edge to see if they where ok. he soon realized that frozenfang was uncocous but mistytail was ok, he saw the 2 shadowclan warriors ok.\nThere alive! silverstar said suprised as she approached the cliff, all of her anger and fighting instincts toward thunderclan gone. \"How do we get them back up though?\"\nleapardfrost forgot about the fight and said \"everyone! try and find a way out for them!.\nWell, its about five foxleangths down, pretty steep, but theres undergrowth and a couple of little ledges. Stonefoot mewed. Without hesitation. Silverstar judged her position, and skidded down the steep slope untill she was on one of the little cliffs. She still couldnt reach the other warriors though.\nSilverstar watched as the cats skidded down, and she made room for them. Stonefoot your strongest, So you can hold the rest of us. Moonshine should go second, then me, then pebbleflower. The cats formed the line and went down. pebblestream grabbed Frosteyes by the scruff, and and stonefoot pulled the cats up. Silverstar watched as frosteyes leaped up and pulled herself on a little ledge. Then she leaped into some undergrowth and treeheart pulled her up. Ok, lets get mistytail now. Silverstar mewed.\nonce frosteyes got up leapardfrost took the cat and layed it down (i duno if its a she or he lol) and asked for hawkpaw to get the medicine cat.\nWe're going to get mistytail ok? Silverstar yelled up to leapardfrost. The cats formed the chain again, and pebbleflower grabbed mistytail.\nleapardfrost took mistytail and layed her down to get ready for the next cat.\nHere comes poppytial! silverstar hollared as they hauled her up. She was a small cat, she had just become a warrior, so stonefoot had to let her get on his back before she could leap up to a little cliff she jumped into some undergrowth then leaped up to the edge, but didnt make it all the way and her claws scrabled to hold on.\nleapardfrost caught her scruff and pulled her up, then he laid her down and started to get ready for the last one.\nThe chain reached down, and they grabbed the unconcious frozenfang by the scruff they pulled him up onto the rocky cliff, and silverstar asked, \"How do we get him up when he's uncouncious?\"\nwait meowed leapardfrost. mistyfur go get water. *mistyfur comes back with water* leapardfrost threw the water at frozenfang andd the cold wet water woke him up. \"there ya go \"\nSilverstar watched as frozenfang leaped up to the top of the cliff. ok! she mewed She let stonefur, moonshine, and pebbleflower go up first. Then she leapt up herself and gazed intently at leapordfrost. \"We will keep the borders the way they are.\" she mewed without hesitation. And with that, she whisked around and lead her cats back to camp."
