"My name is Doyle Maurer, and I help education-focused marketing teams grow and engage their audience by creating consistent photo and video content on an affordable monthly basis.\nI grew up in West Virginia where storytelling is at the core of building and sharing cultural traditions - from old folk music to recipes our great grandmothers passed down in the kitchen. From a young age, I fell in love with the power of a well-crafted story, and since then I\u2019ve made it my goal to build strong mission-driven communities through well-crafted content.\nI\u2019m fascinated by the intersection of creativity, technology, and sociology. My focus is on building relationships with education-focused organizations that believe in changing the lives of educators, students, and families. I work with a standardized process that makes audience research, content creation, and scheduling content easy and effective for everyone involved.\nI've had the pleasure of working with a variety of clients, including Education Week, The National Alliance For Public Charter Schools, The City of Falls Church, and many more.\nI'm currently in Denver CO., and available for travel. I\u2019d love to hear about your challenges and see if we might be a good fit for each other."
