"Royal Bearing\uff08Singapore\uff09Co.\uff0cltd .is an Barrel roller bearings trading company specialized in Barrel roller bearings and industrial machinery and equipment.\nRoyal Bearing\uff08Singapore\uff09Co.\uff0cltd is your source for valuable information about themachinery you own or are planning to own. It's totally free, and it's a Royal Bearing\uff08Singapore\uff09exclusive!\nNeed Barrel roller bearings about using your machine?\nBarrel roller bearings are single row, self-aligning roller bearings. They comprise solid outer rings with a concave raceway, solid inner rings with two ribs and a cylindrical or tapered bore and barrel rollers with cages. The bearings cannot be dismantled.\nBarrel roller bearings are single row, self-aligning roller bearings. They comprise solid outer rings with a concave raceway, solid inner rings with two ribs and a cylindrical or tapered bore as well as barrel rollers with cages. The bearings cannot be dismantled.\nBearings with a tapered bore have a bore taper 1:12 and the suffix K.\nThese bearings are also available with an adapter sleeve for locating purposes. The adapter sleeves are included in the dimension tables and must be specified in addition when ordering.\nThe bearings can be lubricated from the end faces using oil or grease.\nUnder normal operating conditions and with a rotating inner ring, barrel roller bearings can swivel approx. 4\u00b0 about their central position. As a result, they permit skewing between the inner and outer ring and can thus compensate misalignments, shaft deflections and housing deformations.\nIf the outer ring rotates or the inner ring undergoes tumbling motion, the angular adjustment facility is smaller. In this case, please contact us.\nBarrel roller bearings with brass cages can be used at operating temperatures from \u201330 \u00b0C to +150 \u00b0C.\nBearing with an outside diameter over 120 mm are dimensionally stable up to +200 \u00b0C."
