"Myah Dellese is a fashion and beauty photographer based in Brooklyn, New York.\nThrough the encouragement of other creatives, family and friends, she explored photography not only as an outlet for creative expression but as a prospective career path.\nWhile studying for her Bachelors degree at Pace University and later Brooklyn college she simultaneously taught herself photography and the ins and out of the fashion industry.\nMyah quickly proceeded to carve out a path for herself within the budding plus size fashion industry. Having grown up plus size with a love of fashion made it easy to relate to her growing clientele. Her ability to capture curves and propensity for bold, clean and crisp images have led to some incredible opportunities; such as lead Visual artist at Nakimuli Inc."
